i've been using the original molecule  air for over a year now  and molecule just came out with the  molecule  air pro that has a lot of improvement so  in this video  we're going to be opening up this new  latest and greatest molecule i'll be  showing you guys  the differences all the upgrades they  have made and kind of given a follow-up  to the original  and all of the benefits and then maybe  some of the downsides that have now  been updated and molecule reached out to  me and wanted to sponsor this video  and have me take a look at the latest  model and this one actually one of the  big selling points is how much air can  move and how much it can  filter now some of you guys may know  that we are building a new home and it's  going to be an open concept kitchen and  main living  space and dining room and i did the math  on that one and it's going to be about  900 to 950 square feet  where this new molecule air pro could do  up to a thousand so it's going to be  perfect  for that room all right right out of the  box we have this nice  bag right here that it comes in and this  thing is definitely  larger i guess it makes sense that it's  so large  because it filters close to twice as  much air in the same amount of time  you can fit much larger spaces at the  top of the box we have this quick  setup instructions here which i'll go  through and show you guys  and we have the user manual let's go  ahead and set this aside  and let's get into the molecule air pro  before we get into the review let's  compare it to the original  molecule as you guys can see the height  is about the same they look  similar overall they both look very nice  in premium compared to most air filters  out there  but the diameter is quite a bit larger  and one of the big changes in the new  pro  and how we can filter so much more air  is the new filtration system  and the fan that's a little bit higher  too so with the original molecule  you lift up like this and then you have  access to  the pre-filter here at the bottom and  then  you can access the pico filter which is  what actually  kills viruses vocs instead of just  trapping them now the new air pro  lift this up this is really heavy wow  the fans actually built  into this piece we can pull out the  filter here  and as you guys can see this is now a  combo filter so  we have the pre-filter on the outside  here it has much more  volume and then the pico filter is on  the inside and then  it will actually light up to activate  the coatings that are on here  molecules pico technology is patented  and it destroys viruses bacterias  mold allergens and chemicals in the air  and that's how molecules stands  out from most of the other air filters  that's what really attracted me  in the first place to the molecules  because they actually look nice in your  house  they're built nicely with aluminum and  nice plastic  both of these use the same exact  technology so they'll both get the job  done  and if you don't need the extra coverage  that the air pro will give you you can  go for the original molecule  or maybe even one of the mini ones so  they have less expensive smaller options  for smaller rooms but with that said  even if you don't have a room that's  you know like we're going to be putting  this one into about a thousand square  feet  you can still have lots of benefits for  example at the quietest setting the air  pro  actually is quieter than the air and  then at its  loudest setting it's also quieter even  though it moves much more  air and on top of that the original air  does have an auto setting  but the newer one has six different fan  speeds and it has two automatic settings  that will actually look at particles in  your air both large ones  medium sized ones and even tiny ones  such as smoke  and it will adjust the speed based on  how much particles are in your air which  is  very nice now recently in spokane we had  horrible horrible smoke in the air the  air quality was above  400 we smelled smoke everywhere i was  getting headaches  when i would be outside and in those  situations it's so nice to have one of  these and we actually have some  friends one of our friends she was  pregnant she was actually going to leave  out of town and go drive to her mom's  and stay there while her husband stayed  and worked  just because of the smoke and so we  actually let her borrow ours  and they were super happy they said the  air was amazing inside of their  little rental house and the molecule did  a fantastic job they had no smoke there  whatsoever there's a few other  differences between the original and the  air pro  first off as you guys can see at the top  here the display is  much larger both are touch screen  displays and you can just  come up and you can get some info with  the larger display it's nicer as well  and we get a lot more information i  really like being able to see  the particulars where it actually shows  up on here  and then of course with both of these  you can actually get the information  that they can give you and you can  adjust both of them using  your smartphone so you don't have to  walk up to it to actually see  and change settings it can be done  really easily on the app and that app  will also remind you  when it's time to change out the filters  and those could be automatically shipped  to your house  a minor difference is that the original  air has this little pre-filter  and that pre-filter needs to be swapped  out every three months and then the main  pico filter is swapped every six months  so you have more swapping going on  as with the air pro that one has an  all-in-one  unit so every once every six months it's  quicker and more simple  easier to swap that out and a big  benefit of that larger pre-filter  around the pico filter is that it's  gonna do a much quicker job at filtering  the ear you don't have to set it to a  higher setting it could be quiet and  still do it much  more quickly i saw some comparisons  against the original one where they  tested  the original molecule against a larger  filter that has a much larger hepa  element  that doesn't destroy things like viruses  and thing and vocs and bacteria and they  just complained about how long it took  and that in a half hour it didn't filter  as much air as the bigger units  that makes sense and with this new one  you have a much larger element  around the pico filter the way that we  use this we keep it plugged in all the  time so we don't just plug it in for a  half hour and leave it  we leave it on on a quiet setting and  then it just  does the job and then the air quality is  great and now let's get into  who should buy a molecule well the first  thing that i want to mention is  if you want to get an air filter that is  going to destroy things and  kill viruses and bacteria and mold  instead of just trapping them  that is a main standout feature in  molecules pico technology is  patented so that right there is a big  deal now the second  big deal i think a lot of reason why a  lot of us like the molecules is  how they look it's a premium product we  have solid aluminum it blends into your  house if you want it to look  nice and look premium it looks great so  not only will filter your air it'll  destroy  um all the things with the pico filter  it will look good while doing so so  that's definitely a standout feature or  most  air filters on the market they do not  look good  now with that it's definitely not a  cheap product it is a premium product  and along with the design and the  ability to destroy viruses and  everything else  you also have the nice touch screen on  the top that's giving you info  you have uh app control so all those  kind of things are built  in and that's also what you get with the  higher price point  the original molecule has done a  fantastic job at our house we definitely  noticed the differences  and then after allergy season was over  and there wasn't a ton of pollen and  everything else in the air  we moved it to our kids bedroom it's  been doing a great job as i mentioned we  shared it with some friends they did a  fantastic job there  and the new air pro it's the same thing  but better in pretty much everywhere  it's quieter better fan speeds  automatic based on the actual particles  that are in your air  you have more info and feedback from it  and it can filter a lot more air in a  much bigger room  and do it quicker as well especially if  you have a smaller sized room it's going  to be able to filter that air much more  often  so if you guys want to get more info on  the new molecule air pro or the older  ones or even the mini ones check out the  link down in the video description  and i want to point out that molecule  didn't tell me what to say  or what not to say other than don't make  any false claims  just give your experience with it which  is what i've done in the previous video  and in this one  um so let me know your thoughts down  below is this a nice upgrade do they add  some features that you're looking for  and i think that's it maybe in the  future a year from now we might do  another follow-up video  thank you guys for watching this has  been max and i'll see you in the next  one  [Music]

